  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting biosphere reserves and Geoparks in the English and Dutch-speaking Caribbean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing the urgent environmental challenges faced by the English- and Dutch-speaking countries in the Caribbean, this initiative aims to strengthen the region&#x2019;s resilience to climate change, biodiversity loss, and ecosystem degradation. Through the promotion and development of biosphere reserves and geoparks, the initiative seeks to reinforce the conservation of biodiversity and geodiversity while supporting sustainable development and environmental education. By fostering a balanced approach between conservation efforts and local economic activities, particularly through sustainable tourism and community engagement, the initiative aims to enhance the resilience and well-being of communities that depend on the Caribbean&#x2019;s natural resources and ecosystems.</narrative>
  </description>
